      mistype:`<p>Dracula is sometimes typed ENTJ - the institutional command, the management of the brides and the castle and the shipping operations to London. But ENTJ builds outward and inhabits institutional leadership as its natural domain. Dracula manages the institutional configuration as the instrument for the synthesis's most complete available expression. He does not inhabit the castle. He built the castle as the framework the synthesis required. The institution serves the vision. ENTJ is the institution.</p><p>The INFJ argument comes from the apparent depth, the private quality of his intelligence, the sense of a long-range vision. But INFJ's vision is held in relation to people through Fe. Dracula's vision is held entirely in relation to the synthesis's requirements, and the people are variables in the synthesis's implementation. The four centuries of the inferior function's absence from the framework's operation is the INTJ, not the INFJ.</p><p>The clincher is his response to Jonathan Harker's shaving. Jonathan cuts himself. Dracula reaches for the cut, stops himself, says "take care how you cut yourself in this country." The inferior Se's most complete portrait: the specific present-tense physical reality, the specific immediate response, and the Te's management structure preventing the inferior function from running the operation the implementation would require. He stops himself. The Te manages the inferior Se. The inferior function had the impulse. The dominant function's management structure intervened. That intervention - the Te managing the inferior function's claim - is the INTJ at its most complete self-portrait.</p>`
