      mistype:`<p>Andre is sometimes typed ENFP - the apparent warmth, the range, the generative quality of the most affecting verses. But ENFP generates from the exterior's available configurations inward. Andre generates from the interior's most complete available assessment outward: the Fi has the assessment and the Ne finds the most available form. The interior is primary. The generation is in service of it.</p><p>The INFJ argument comes from the apparent visionary quality and the comprehensive understanding. But INFJ synthesises the pattern. Andre generates from the interior's most complete available assessment through the Ne's most available form. The generation is iterative, not convergent.</p><p>The clincher is the outfit. He has been one of the most consistently distinctive dressers in music for thirty years. Each outfit is the Fi's most complete available assessment of what the specific present-tense configuration of the specific moment requires as the most available physical expression, delivered through the Se's most available instrument, endorsed with the completeness the Fi provides for the specific engagements it has fully designated. He dresses because the interior requires the specific expression. The Ne found the form. The inferior function noted that it was unusual.</p>`
