      mistype:`<p>Sheeran is sometimes typed ENFP - the apparent warmth, the range of the genre engagement, the enthusiastic relational quality. But ENFP generates from the exterior's available configurations inward. Sheeran generates from the interior's most complete available assessment outward: the Fi has the assessment and the Se delivers it through the most available physical instrument. The direction is interior-first.</p><p>The ESFP argument comes from the physical expressiveness and the apparent present-tense inhabitation. But ESFP is Se dominant: the present moment is primary and the Fi provides the warmth. Sheeran's Fi is dominant: the specific assessment of what each specific moment contains is primary, and the Se delivers what the Fi has assessed through the most available physical instrument. The interior requirement is primary.</p><p>The clincher is the loop pedal. He chose an instrument that required the most available self-sufficiency - building every available layer from the most available single instrument in the most available present-tense configuration - because the Fi's assessment of what the most complete available expression required was the specific quality of the specific voice and the specific guitar being the most available sufficient instrument. The loop pedal was the Se's most available instrument for what the Fi had assessed. He plays alone. The Fi requires it. The Se builds it.</p>`
